			'''
			Left-click fires a supersonic granite monolith that pierces up to 6 enemies
			Right-click launches a slow-moving beacon in any direction
			Press Right-click again while the beacon is active to Castle — swap positions with it!
			Swapping deals guaranteed critical damage to all enemies in your path,
			detonates the beacon into cross shockwaves, and grants invincibility and +30 defense
			'The fortress moves. The fortress strikes.'
			'''
	}
